(41, 70, 'Id Shoes', 'upload/bussiness-card/logo/20220703101417id-logo1.png', NULL, '+91', '9825024750', NULL, '<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Roboto; font-size: 14px;\">We are leading Traders & Suppliers of Safety Shoes, Uniform Shoes, Civil Shoes, Ladies Uniform Shoes, Gum Boots, Rainy Shoes for over a decade. Our Uniqueness lies with trading of our products combined with the latest technology.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Roboto; font-size: 14px;\">We focus on providing quality products for which all our foot wears are thoroughly checked and double checked before supply. Our years of experience lead us to develop budget and economical range of footwear to suit the small and medium scale industries. This has earned us a name in the industry and we are proud that we satisfy our esteemed buyers each time, every time.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Roboto; font-size: 14px;\">Mission:</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Roboto; font-size: 14px;\">To protect from the hazards of the workplace and reduce the risks to the minimum by providing safety solutions and products keeping the products well in budget and of course with uncompromised quality.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Roboto; font-size: 14px;\">Our motto:</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Roboto; font-size: 14px;\">To set up the industry with the objective of providing safety shoes which boast of high quality keeping them economical and within the reach with timely delivery.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Roboto; font-size: 14px;\">Quality Assurance:</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Roboto; font-size: 14px;\">Giving most importance to the quality and customer satisfaction, we use only superior leather and allied materials like steel toes, steel plates, collars, lace, antistatic sole.</p>', '<p><span style=\" font-family: Roboto; font-size: 14px;\">ID SHOES,&nbsp;Mahatma Gandhi Road ,</span></p><p><span style=\"color: font-family: Roboto; font-size: 14px;\">Vadodara-390001, Gujarat, India</span></p>', '22.300050', '73.206490', 'https://www.idshoes.in', NULL, '2022-04-29 10:11:53', '2022-07-06 08:41:06'),
